Q) Longest palindrome substring
Methode 1:
okay so here you need to basically check for palindrome for even as well as odd palindrome. for odd palindrome cput r = l = i
and for even palindrome checking put l = i and r = i+1; you will have to keep replacing maxlen of the palindrome string with 
the bigger value present in r-l+1 (this will give you the length of the palindrome substring), you then need to store this in a temp string 
palin using s.substr(l,maxlen); here l will be the starting char of the palindrome. In the end return palin;


class Solution {
public:
    string longestPalindrome(string s) {
int n = s.size();
int maxlen = 0;
string palin = "";
int l,r;
for(int i = 0; i<n;i++){
l =i;
r = i;
while(l>=0 && r<n && s[r]==s[l]){
if(r-l+1 > maxlen){
maxlen = r-l+1;
palin = s.substr(l, maxlen);
}
l--;
r++;
}
l =  i;
r = i+1;
while(l>=0 && r<n && s[r]==s[l]){
if(r-l+1 > maxlen){
maxlen = r-l+1;
palin = s.substr(l, maxlen);
}
l--;
r++;
}
}
return palin;
}
};
